  "description": "A production-grade C# library for converting data between JSON, YAML, TOML, and TOON (Token-Oriented Object Notation) with full TOON SPEC v2.0 compliance. Features YAML/TOML bidirectional conversion, parallel processing, Span<T> optimizations, automatic tabular detection, and significant performance improvements. Perfect for cross-ecosystem configuration management (Rust Cargo.toml, Python pyproject.toml).",
